WEBVTT

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:02.940
I love ya!

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:03.890
I love you!

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:05.310
I really, really love you!

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.750
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.710
Wow! Sometimes, it feels great to shout!

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.890
Today's episode is all about shouting out your feelings to the people who matter to you.

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:18.390
You gotta be honest with the ones you love, right?

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.320
Oh, Miki, you're so grown-up. 

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.610
There's one more thing we've gotta shout:

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:24.920
Doki!

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:02.430
Amu-chan, why're you spacin' out?

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:05.930
Oh, just thinkin' about how Lulu and Nana are in Paris now...

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:09.830
Nana was quite a handful.

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:12.940
But it's rather sad that they're gone, don't you think?

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:15.480
Yeah...

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:16.990
But...

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.260
I have a hunch the other one won't be leaving us anytime soon.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:25.830
Even though he's freeloading, he doesn't know the meaning of "consideration," does he? 

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:31.180
I ain't freeloadin' 'cause I wanna, you know-nya.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:36.150
If I could just find Ikuto, I wouldn't have to lower myself... 

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:40.290
Day after day, I'm out there lookin' for him, until I'm totally worn out-nya.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:42.220
And hungry, too-nya!

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:44.460
Yoru...

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:50.690
I wonder where Ikuto is.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:54.690
Ami-chan, I love you!

00:02:55.670 --> 00:03:01.160
Episode 90 
I Want to Tell You These Feelings

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:05.590
I love you to bits, Ami-chan!

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:08.610
Sorry.

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:10.980
What's going on?

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:12.190
Oh, Amu-chan.

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:17.980
Next Sunday, there's this "Shout out Your Love! Doki-Doki Confession Contest!" 

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:20.770
And Dad wants to enter with Ami-chan.

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:24.580
But I'm teaming up with the boys from my kindergarten!

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:25.890
Boys?

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:28.430
I'm running away from home!

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:34.400
Shouting out your love? What a romantic event.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.360
Why don't you do it, Amu-chan?

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.740
With Tadase-kun.

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:40.560
Are you dense? Not on your life! 

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:47.320
Hey, guys! Do you know about the "Shout Out Your Love! Doki-Doki Confession Contest"?

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:50.200
Oh, you mean "Love-Shout."

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.860
It already has a nickname?

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:55.050
Do you honestly believe a King would do something

00:03:55.050 --> 00:03:57.420
so embarrassing as declaring their love before others?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:01.470
Wait, do you even have someone you want to confess to?

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.760
Don't be preposterous! I said nothing of the sort!

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.010
Could that someone perhaps be...

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.060
Miki's all lovey-dovey! 

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.690
Miki-tan's heart is easily won! 

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:14.030
If El were here, she'd say something like:

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:19.290
"Aha! We've got four bars of love reception here!"

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:20.530
You've got her down, don't you?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.350
Sync: 100%! 

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:24.740
So what about this event?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:30.790
I was just thinking about how Amu-chi and Tadase should enter.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.690
Yaya, what are you saying?!

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:33.940
Well, enough about that.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:37.000
If we don't investigate Easter's Death Rebel plan right away-

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:37.960
Yeah!

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:41.380
Hey, enough about what?

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.720
If all it took to love each other forever was to yell about it, it'd be too easy.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.890
What's that supposed to mean?

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:52.720
Man, you guys are totally taking this "shout out your love" thing too lightly.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:56.470
It's really important to put your feelings into words and express them!

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.430
Are you quoting manga again? 

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:00.930
You know, there's also a rumor

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:05.780
that the couples who take part in that contest will be bound together forever.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.390
Isn't that oh-so <i>romantic</i>? 

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:10.880
Bound together forever?

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:18.560
I totally approve of Yaya-chan's idea.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.100
Not you, too...

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:23.870
Well, there will be many people at an event like this,

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:27.960
so I think Easter might show up and try to aim for all those heart's eggs.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.720
But that means...

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:33.990
I think it would be more natural for one of us to actually participate...

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:37.280
Oh yeah! Things are gonna get interestin'!

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:39.810
'Kay then, I'll just enter you guys real quick.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:40.920
And I'm off!

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:42.790
Hey, Yaya!

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:00.210
If you have to hate someone, hate your real father.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:05.670
It's because he up and disappeared that you've suffered this fate.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:10.670
However, the Death Rebel plan has begun.

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:16.080
You have much dancing yet to do for me, my puppet.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.700
I just can't do this.

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:26.220
Shouting out my love in front of other people?

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:29.470
Yeah, that's definitely not your usual style, Amu-chan.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:32.240
But would you turn down Tadase-kun?

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:36.780
Amu-chan.

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:37.920
Yes?

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:43.250
About that... If you don't want to do it, we really shouldn't.

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:51.740
I never said I didn't want to do it!

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:52.370
Are you sure?

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.050
Of course, of course!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.760
Thank goodness!

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:59.860
The couples who shout out their love for each other will be bound together forever.

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:05.500
I've been thinking... If that's true, it'd be really nice...

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:07.320
Although, it's probably just a rumor. 

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:09.790
Tadase-kun!

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:13.190
He captured your heart before shouting a word!

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:14.750
That's our Prince.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.770
He's not running away anymore, that's for sure.

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:26.580
Will you really abandon your daddy?

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.030
What am I going to do?

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:32.730
Reconnaissance report!

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:33.390
So?

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:37.470
It seems Ami-chan is going in a cute pink dress!

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:40.310
All right! We can't let Ami-chan upstage us!

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:41.820
Let's go all out...

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:42.880
...and look...

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.400
...super cool!

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.730
It's not a competition!

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:49.460
I don't know why you're getting so excited about this!

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.130
Amu-chan...

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.890
You're rarely honest with yourself, so if you don't go through with this,

00:07:55.890 --> 00:08:01.160
we're worried that you'll never tell Tadase-kun how you truly feel.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:04.030
This is a wonderful opportunity, you know?

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.040
So that's why we were kind of thinking...

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:11.090
Ikuto!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.680
Where are you-nya?!

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.700
What are you doing?

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:17.540
Isn't it obvious-nya?

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:19.900
I'm rehearsing for the Love-Shout Contest-nya.

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:22.090
I think you're a bit confused...

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:25.770
Love-Shout is about shouting out your <i>love</i>. 

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.560
Duh, and I <i>love</i> Ikuto-nya!

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.090
Yoru...

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:35.590
Ikuto! If you can hear my voice, answer me-nya!

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:40.270
I'm lonely without you-nya!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.420
The day of Love-Shout!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:54.380
Tamako-san, I love you!

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.940
Hurry, hurry!

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:58.600
It's already started!

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:02.770
This many people came to shout out their love?

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:05.120
And now, for our next couple...

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:07.950
Well, this isn't a couple exactly.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:12.110
They're friends from Hanami Kindergarten's Plum Class!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:13.240
Ami!

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:16.830
So let's hear those shouts of love, right away!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:17.820
Please go ahead.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:21.990
I love you, Ami! Ami, I love you!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:25.020
How will you respond, Ami-chan?

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.750
Thank you.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:31.750
But I can't choose just one of you...

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.820
I love you all!

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:37.370
Aw! She loves each and every one of them!

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:40.170
Isn't that nice, Plum Class boys?

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:42.170
Yay! 

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:47.160
Please take home this participant's prize, the love-love hoop!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.520
That's exactly what I wanted!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.900
So she actually just wanted the entry prize...

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:57.550
It all makes sense...

00:09:57.550 --> 00:10:01.630
Now, next up is Nikaidou Yuu-san and Sanjo Yukari-san!

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:02.450
If you please...

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:06.800
Nikaidou-sensei and Sanjo-san?

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:07.980
Huh?

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:12.830
How could you do something so embarrassing?!

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:15.380
Well, I wanted the entry prize!

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:18.710
I had a flash of inspiration that we could use that love-love hoop

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:21.350
in the dance choreography for Utau-chan's new song.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.160
I don't see it.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:28.960
I feel sorry for Utau-chan if you just decide things like that without talking to her first.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:34.020
And I really don't think her fans would want to see Utau-chan spinning a "love-love" hoop...

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:38.700
But I'm just trying to do what's best for Utau-chan.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:42.460
You don't understand me at all, Yuu...

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:46.370
I'm sorry... Maybe I went too far...

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:49.170
I'm not ready to forgive you yet!

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:51.160
Apologize properly!

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:51.960
I'm sorry...

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.530
Again, with feeling!

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:54.550
I'm sorry.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.590
Say it louder!

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:58.510
I'm sorry!

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:05.080
Oh! That's quite an original way of shouting out your love!

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:09.090
Here's your participant's prize, the love-love hoop!

00:11:09.090 --> 00:11:11.160
And here's to your eternal happiness.

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:17.920
Sanjo-san and Sensei have got a good vibe going there.

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.310
I wonder if they'll get back together.

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:24.260
Though it saddens me, I'll pray for his happiness. 

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:28.220
See? If you put your feelings into words, good things will happen!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:28.870
Yeah...

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.380
Guess so.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:47.160
The Love-Shout Contest continues!

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:49.640
You don't have to shout, too, Su.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:57.730
I love you more than anything in the whole wide world, Cinnamon-chan!

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:03.280
Let's stay in love, even when we're 100.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:05.170
Grandpa!

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:07.030
Ah, sorry 'bout that...

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:11.350
Everyone seems to be having fun.

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:12.370
Yeah...

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:17.060
The next couple is Hotori Tadase-kun and Hinamori Amu-san.

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.720
Come on down!

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:20.740
W-What're we going to do?

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:23.480
Don't worry, I'm here with you, so...

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:24.340
Right...

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:28.580
Tadase-kun always has that princely aura...

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:33.700
All right, go out and have a blast!

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:39.050
I've been thinking a long time about what to shout out here...

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:41.720
But after hearing everyone else's words,

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:45.970
I understand now that I should just honestly express my feelings.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.340
What's the matter, Darling?

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:55.110
She hasn't even introduced me to him properly!

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:56.680
Dear...

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:01.650
I...

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.140
That sound...

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.320
The crowd's hearts' eggs!

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:32.890
It's like they're being drawn out by the sound of the violin!

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:35.090
Amu-chan, let's go.

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:38.750
Let's go.

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:40.510
Right.

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.230
More and more X Eggs are gathering!

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:07.700
Ikuto!

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:21.540
Ikuto, silence those children.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.650
Let me go-dechu!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.440
I can't move...

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:44.440
This hurts!

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:46.310
Ikuto!

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:47.670
Stop it-nya!

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:50.490
It's no use. He's completely under their control!

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:52.490
Amu-chan!

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:53.740
Right!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.900
My heart:

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.690
My heart:

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:01.000
Unlock!

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:14.080
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:18.950
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:34.400
My heart: Unlock.

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:57.210
Character Transformation: Death Rebel.

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:11.320
Ikuto!

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:40.180
Amu-chan!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:41.330
Amu!

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:45.350
Amu-chan!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:46.230
Amu!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.910
Ikuto, can you hear me?!

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:55.120
What's happened to you?

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:59.730
Why've you Character Transformed into this Death Rebel guy I don't know nothin' about-nya?!

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:00.950
Yoru...

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:03.740
You were rude and a pain to take care of,

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:07.400
but I want the good 'ole Ikuto I know to come back-nya!

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:10.260
I'll handle everything, so...

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:13.480
So snap out of it-nya!

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:16.640
I want the Ikuto I love to come back-nya!

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:20.450
Ikuto, you can hear Yoru's voice, right?

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:22.140
You can hear mine, right?

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:25.600
Amu...

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.770
Ikuto...

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.030
Ikuto?

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:44.120
What's the matter?

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.920
The wavelength is fluctuating.

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:48.820
Ikuto-kun might be regaining control of his mind.

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:50.540
Raise the output of the tuning fork.

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.630
But Ikuto-kun's body will...

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:53.920
It doesn't matter!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:56.760
Chichimaru!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:57.300
Yessir.

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:06.610
Ikuto?

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:14.900
Ikuto!

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:17.200
Are you okay?

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.470
Tadase-kun.

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:36.330
Amu-chan, purify the X Eggs while you have the chance!

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:38.090
Amu-chan...

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:40.840
If you put your feelings into words, they're sure to get through.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:44.100
Yoru's words... My words...

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.900
I'm sure they got through to Ikuto.

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:51.520
But it's not just the words, it's the heart behind them... 

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:57.830
Platinum Heart!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.360
What is it?

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:23.430
We're detecting the Embryo!

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:29.520
The Embryo!

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:32.980
Capture it at once! What are you doing, Ikuto?

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:36.000
It's no use. He's been severely weakened. 

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:37.530
We must retrieve him immediately.

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:40.280
Right when we needed him most...

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.110
There it went.

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:54.280
Amu-chan?

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:58.050
Ikuto's eyes looked so sad... 

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:03.720
That was the real Ikuto, at least for a minute there.

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:12.940
Ikuto?

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.760
He's gone-nya.

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:18.330
Those goons from Easter took him away again-nya.

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:44.480
We're detecting the Embryo!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:49.250
Could it be that the Embryo... 

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:05.360
Oh yeah! You never did yell out your love for Tadase, did you, Amu-chi?

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:08.900
Oh, well, it's okay... The contest is over and all...

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:12.540
Well <i>you</i> might be okay with it, but I bet Tadase isn't.

00:21:12.780 --> 00:21:16.000
If you don't get a response, the shout goes to waste, you know.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:19.080
But I didn't finish what I had to say...

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:22.190
Remember? That's when all the X Eggs appeared.

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:23.940
Now that you mention it, yeah.

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:27.230
Fine, then start from the shouting part, Tadase!

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:30.230
You really want them to do this, huh?

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:34.050
It's really important to put your feelings into words and express them!

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:38.970
It's of course possible to express your feelings in words,

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:42.320
but you can do it without them as well.

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:50.690
Tadase-kun?

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:54.620
Amu-chan.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:13.760
Let's go, Tadase-kun!

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:15.000
Yes, let's...

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:18.080
Shut up, you guys!

00:23:50.410 --> 00:23:53.590
Why won't Nagi's Guardian Egg hatch?

00:23:53.590 --> 00:23:56.570
Perhaps he is a shy person?

00:23:56.570 --> 00:23:59.470
Maybe if we gave him some motivation... 

00:23:59.470 --> 00:24:01.560
Okay then, let's all call out to him!

00:24:01.560 --> 00:24:02.740
Come on out!

00:24:02.740 --> 00:24:04.690
We have yummy candy! 

00:24:04.690 --> 00:24:05.940
Wait, we have candy?!

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:07.160
What, what?

00:24:08.020 --> 00:24:10.150
You guys...

00:24:10.150 --> 00:24:12.380
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.380 --> 00:24:14.130
Full Throttle! My Rhythm! 

00:24:14.130 --> 00:24:17.800
Ride the rhythm, and welcome a new Guardian Character!

00:24:17.800 --> 00:24:19.670
Yo! What's up?
